<section class="page-head"><span class="eyebrow">CUSTOMER ASSESSMENT</span><h1>Tell us about your routine</h1><p>This initial version accepts adults aged 18+. Your assessment is used to determine the appropriate service workflow.</p></section><form class="form-card wide" method="post" action="/assessment"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?= Fitmeal\Core\Security::csrfToken() ?>"><div class="form-grid"><label>Age (18–100)<input type="number" name="age" min="18" max="100" required></label><label>Height (cm)<input type="number" name="height_cm" min="100" max="230" step="0.1" required></label><label>Weight (kg)<input type="number" name="weight_kg" min="25" max="300" step="0.1" required></label><label>Food preference<select name="food_preference" required><option value="">Select</option><option value="vegetarian">Vegetarian</option><option value="eggetarian">Eggetarian</option><option value="non_vegetarian">Non-vegetarian</option><option value="vegan">Vegan</option></select></label><label>Goal<select name="goal" required><option value="healthy_eating">Healthy eating</option><option value="weight_management">Healthy weight management</option><option value="meal_organization">Meal organization</option></select></label><label>Activity level<select name="activity_level"><option value="sedentary">Mostly sitting</option><option value="light">Light activity</option><option value="moderate">Moderately active</option><option value="high">Highly active</option></select></label><label>City / region<input name="region" maxlength="100" placeholder="e.g. Nagpur, Maharashtra"></label><label>Daily food budget (₹)<input type="number" name="daily_food_budget" min="0" max="10000" value="200"></label><label class="span-two">Food allergies (if any)<textarea name="allergies" rows="2" maxlength="1000" placeholder="List known food allergies, or leave blank"></textarea></label><label class="span-two">Do you have a medical or other special nutrition need requiring professional review?<se